# Half of #5267: the slice call carries no remediation identity.
MODULE: DrivenOnlyByFollowersSlicesAnother
TARGET: DrivenOnlyByFollowers
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a driver slices a remediation it does not follow
PERTURBS: Slice
BOUNDS: OpCount = 3, MaxStalls = 0

--- FIND
    /\ remOwner = opFollows[o]
    /\ (~Stop(o) \/ ~CancelAccepted(o))
--- REPLACE
    /\ (~Stop(o) \/ ~CancelAccepted(o))
--- END
